        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E71q9xKZSpMfbyLhsjKuNODzTrE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/27252-best-potatoes-youll-ever-taste-DDMFS-step-01-1-1566-2-7a73e3de4c8c455cae5e0beda0f50b16.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/27252/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add potatoes, and cook until almost done, about 10 minutes. Don't overcook otherwise the potatoes will break apart. Drain, and cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
